Subject: [PATCH] image: make buffer recycler setup cheap

Since e334652 every JxlDecoder::new() fills 768 recycler buckets keyed by
SipHash, which costs more than decoding a typical fuzz input and halved the
exec rate. Build the buckets on first use and hash the (usize, usize) keys
with a multiplicative hash into a presized map.
---
diff --git a/jxl/src/image/recycler.rs b/jxl/src/image/recycler.rs
index d9f108c..dc325a2 100644
--- a/jxl/src/image/recycler.rs
+++ b/jxl/src/image/recycler.rs
@@ -4,6 +4,8 @@
